{"timestamp": 1779337469.8963084, "event_type": "body_reported", "tick": 12, "data": {"caller": "player_3", "reason": "Diana reported a dead body", "bodies": [{"room": "upper_engine", "victim_name": "Frank"}]}}
{"timestamp": 1779337469.896936, "event_type": "phase_changed", "tick": 12, "data": {"phase": "discussion"}}
{"timestamp": 1779337477.0034485, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 12, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "I just found Frank dead in the upper engine. My path was from security, through electrical, into medbay, and then I went straight to upper engine for a task, which is where I found the body. I didn't run into anyone else along the way, so whoever did this must have slipped out towards the oxygen side or the lower engine. Did anyone see someone heading that way or coming from upper engine?"}}
{"timestamp": 1779337490.763484, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 12, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "Diana, I can actually answer your question. I started in navigation, moved to storage, and had just gotten to medbay when this meeting was called. \n\nWhile I was in storage around tick 9, I saw Bob walk in coming directly from the lower engine. Since upper engine connects straight down to lower engine, that path makes perfect sense for a getaway. He could have killed Frank in upper engine and fled south to avoid you coming from medbay. \n\nBob, you need to explain your route right now and what you were doing on the engine side of the ship, because from my perspective, that path makes you my top suspect. Everyone else, let's hear what Bob has to say before we vote."}}
{"timestamp": 1779337511.9565973, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 12, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "Alice is telling the truth about seeing me in Storage at tick 9 and 10. My exact route was Oxygen, down to Upper Engine, through Lower Engine, and then into Storage where I bumped into her. \n\nHowever, I need to be completely clear: I did *not* see Frank or a dead body when I passed through Upper Engine early in the round. Since I was already all the way down in Storage with Alice by tick 9, and Diana found the body later, the murder almost certainly happened *after* I had already left the upper left side of the ship. \n\nThe killer likely entered Upper Engine from Oxygen or Cafeteria right after I headed south. Charlie, Eve \u2014 we really need to hear your locations. Was anyone on the north side of the map near Cafeteria or Oxygen? I am a Goose, and my alibi is that Alice literally saw me far away from the crime scene. Let's hear from the rest before doing anything rash."}}
{"timestamp": 1779337527.9279647, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 12, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "I can shed some light on the early part of the round. I started in Medbay and Charlie was there doing tasks with me. Right around tick 2, I clearly saw Frank leave Medbay heading straight for Upper Engine. \n\nAfter that, I went north into the Cafeteria and then across to Oxygen to do my O2 filter task. I never set foot in Upper Engine, so I didn't see the body. \n\nBob, you just admitted your route was Oxygen down through Upper Engine. If Frank walked into Upper Engine near the start of the round like I saw, and you went through there heading south, your paths definitely would have crossed. You claiming you didn't see him or a body really doesn't add up with the timing. Alice catching you coming from that exact direction in Storage seals it for me. You must have killed Frank as you passed through and fled south. Bob is definitely our Duck here."}}
{"timestamp": 1779337539.9182262, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 12, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "Eve, you are completely lying about your route, and I caught you. \n\nI was in Medbay with you and Frank early on. While you claim you went north into the Cafeteria and never set foot in Upper Engine, I explicitly saw you leave Medbay heading directly into Upper Engine at tick 4! \n\nFrank was found dead in Upper Engine, and you just lied about your path to cover up the fact that you went in there right after him. You killed Frank and now you're trying to use Bob's route as a convenient scapegoat. \n\nEveryone, Eve is the Duck. She lied about where she went to frame Bob. We need to vote Eve right now."}}
